<headline>FREE TO TRADE - William Jewell College, Mo..</headline>
<text>
<p>HEALTH AND EDUCATIONAL FACILITIES AUTHORITY OF</p>
<p>THE STATE OF MISSOURI EDUCATIONAL FACILITIES</p>
<p>RE: $6,875,000</p>
<p>REFUNDING REVENUE BONDS SERIES 1996</p>
